translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_6df21e82:

    yu "我知道,我知道,我只想找到奇梅,把他带回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Hezzong_Puro_Forest_Dialogue_bc7e7f02:

