translate schinese_rewrite Moine_Inbetween_Land_3cb2a372:

    "看着,即使月亮也开始流血 进入星空之夜 当你擦擦你的眼睛 以获得更清晰的视野。"

translate schinese_rewrite Moine_Inbetween_Land_966cdbec:

